  "description": "The anti-gravity gravity machine. Introducing the ONE.2, the first CBF™ super enduro/freeride bike from the fun junkies at Canfield. Built around 29-inch wheels and the patented Canfield Balance Formula™suspension platform, the ONE.2 is a super enduro weapon engineered to take on the roughest race tracks and biggest bike-park lines with confidence. And thanks to the ultra-efficient CBF™ tuned linkage, it pedals like nothing with 8 inches of travel should, to ensure nothing is wasted, whether you’re sprinting across the finish line or into the next jump.\n\nBUILD SPECS\n\nFEATURES\n\nGEOMETRY\n\nGeo based on 29” wheels and 601mm axle-to-crown fork\n*Öhlins DH fork has 620mm axle-to-crown w/ 62.2 HA\n*180/190mm fork w/ 592mm axle-to-crown results in 63.5 HA\n**(27.5\" wheels result in 337.8mm bb height)",
